  "details": "Game causes a BSOD on launch or within a few seconds after entering the game. I use the default home world.  \n\nTroubleshooting Steps:\n\n-Drivers and BIOS are all up to date. \n\n-Memory Integrity is on (tried with it off as well)\n\n-Installed in different drives\n\n-Installed and uninstalled other EAC games (they all launch)\n\n-Removed EAC files and reinstalled\n\nI'm trying to get VRchat to put out more recent output logs than the ones I'm attaching, but it's not creating any.",
